<translation id="15408169957028265">Chrome ichida Google Qidiruvni qayta ochish</translation>
<translation id="9039191226880557963">Optimiumga kirish</translation>
<translation id="1547469039832541117">Belgilangan vazifani yakunlaydi.</translation>
