<translation id="7437253251955408447">Barcha Optimium oynalarini yoping va qaytadan urinib ko‘ring.</translation>
<translation id="4544226979083343619">Oynani ulashish uchun tizim sozlamalarida Optimium brauzeriga ekranni yozib olish uchun ruxsat bering.</translation>
<translation id="7742324910239513884"><ph name="EXISTING_USER" /> hisobiga allaqachon kirilgan.  Internetni alohida kezish uchun Optimiumga shaxsiy profilingiz (<ph name="USER_EMAIL_ADDRESS" />) orqali kiring.</translation>
