<translation id="5279936464959604532">Tizim audiosini ulashish uchun Tizim sozlamalarini ochib, Optimium uchun “Faqat tizim audiosini yozib olish” ruxsatini bering. Keyin Optimium qayta ishga tushirilishi kerak.</translation>
